---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import{book}from '../../lib/book';
---
<Layout title="社区"><header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">文字之外，还有回声</p><h1>书友之间</h1><p>一段感想，一个故事，一次重逢。</p></header><div class="community-layout"><section><form id="post-form" class="form-stack post-composer" data-auth-only hidden><label>写一条动态<textarea name="content" maxlength="500" required placeholder="最近读到什么，或者想起了什么？"></textarea></label><label>引用一篇文章（可选）<select name="article_id"><option value="">不引用文章</option>{book.articles.map(a=><option value={a.id}>{a.title}</option>)}</select></label><button>发布动态</button></form><nav class="tabs" aria-label="社区动态分类"><a href="?tab=hot" data-feed-tab="hot">热门</a><a href="?tab=latest" data-feed-tab="latest">最新</a><a href="?tab=following" data-feed-tab="following">关注</a></nav><div data-feed aria-live="polite">正在看看书友们聊了什么…</div><button data-more-feed hidden>查看更多动态</button></section><aside><div data-highlights></div><p><a href="/community/guidelines/">社区规范 →</a></p></aside></div><script>import '../../scripts/community';</script></Layout>
